// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
// Signing configuration scaffolding (Muse parity §4.5 C-13).
//
// Copy this file to `Signing.xcconfig` (same folder), fill in the
// founder values, and — in Xcode — set it as the target's base
// configuration, or paste the values under Signing & Capabilities.
// `Signing.xcconfig` itself is founder-local state: never commit a
// real team id alongside distribution credentials.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =            // 10-character Apple Developer team id (founder supplies)
// PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.kriyadot.companion
// CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
//
// With the team set + automatic signing, Xcode mints the development
// certificate and provisioning profile (with the Push Notifications
// capability from the entitlements) on first device build.
